  <item>
    <title>EP.5 劝饭——做饭101的101</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67b8e3a2606e5c5940065963</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67b8e3a2606e5c5940065963</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 21 Feb 2025 20:46:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容非常轻松，并没有什么特别的shownotes需要写——</span></p><span></span><p><span>但……还是写一下吧：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="132">02:12</a> 炒鸡蛋应该怎么炒；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> 如何制作苦瓜炒蛋与苦瓜鸡蛋饼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> 如何开锅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="643">10:43</a> 热锅冷油与如何花式煎蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="750">12:30</a> 厨房中的第一种危险：飞溅的热油</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 炝锅面：给做饭者的色香味俱全 （推荐：老饭骨教的炝锅面）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1120">18:40</a> 电饭锅五花肉 （推荐：厨师长教你：方正软糯“红烧肉”的酒店做法，行业秘密全盘脱出，让你在家也能做出惊艳的感觉！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> 厨房：家中的不祥之地</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 君子远庖厨 这话哪儿来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> “超度”小鸡的童谣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> 您的好友：暖心孟子上线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">29:10</a> 如何给肉去腥</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：《黄油面包圆舞曲》莫扎特——感谢精神股东 HD453761y 提供的音乐建议~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面：一种……极致的敷衍🤔</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 联系我们：老张 小红书 新建序列影像研习室；</span></p><span></span><p><span>编辑助理：多云 小红书 多云</span></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：青年地下室</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作邮箱：harryzhang0127@163.com</span></p>]]></description>
