  <item>
    <title>「最近阴暗爬行，要不咱一起？」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67575a5217cd5416adc884fa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67575a5217cd5416adc884fa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Dec 2024 22:35:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>也许适当地「阴暗爬行」是为了更好地「直立行走」</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们可以一起走进这间「地下室」 也可以一起挽着手大踏步地走在地面上</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一期节目是个漫长的「自我阐述」：这是一档什么样的播客，我们为什么要做这档播客，为什么起这样一个名字？</span></p><span></span><p><span>我邀请到了我的老朋友，研究生同学，也是我的播客事业领路者，脚踝部播客主理人（她自己说的）Lingge和我一起与大家聊天。她将在接下来的89分钟里与各位分享她的经历，同我们一起读陀氏的《地下室手记》。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART ONE </span></strong><em><strong><span>「阴暗爬行」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 反思过后，我发现自己在Lingge的节目中「不诚实」</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> </span><strong><span>别人的成功会给我带来压力，我无法为别人的成就开心</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> </span><strong><span>方言辨析：什么叫“蛐蛐别人”</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 高自尊，低自信：《自伤自恋的精神分析》</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>PART TWO </span></strong><em><strong><span>「地下室手记」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 生活的流动性会带你前行，但上班的日子很黏腻</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1980">33:00</a> 理性退场：沟通失效的情况下，我们只能发疯</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 对单一标准的追求，让我们困在负反馈中</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2640">44:00</a> 玩自己的游戏，逃离金本主义的规则</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2880">48:00</a> 并不合适的类比：地下室人与妓女的交流，让我想起我所在的一个行业，令我战栗</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a>《地下室手记》是“老登文学”嘛？Lingge怎么看~</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3420">57:00</a> 「男人必看的X部电影」：“老登”作品如何完成对观众的规训</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 「登峰造极」北上合拍的港片们</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3720">1:02:00</a> 一个马甲：能力有限，「青年地下室」开放讨论</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>PART THREE</span></strong><em><strong><span>「地下室里有什么？」</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk2GBmXKXMLwH8Ls_zl8Jux6GXmI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>（嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎嘎老张的设计初稿就是长成这样的哈哈哈哈哈）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 「青年地下室」的初心：小猫小兔小老鼠小鸽子与大象都欢迎您</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4020">1:07:00</a> 掉书袋：洞穴理论</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4140">1:09:00</a> 突然间的自伤自厌：脚踝部播客们会努力的！</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>PART FOUR </span></strong><em><strong><span>回到地面</span></strong></em></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4320">1:12:00</a> 选择太多，但一条路都没有走好</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4500">1:15:00</a> 过上有实感的生活：《时差一小时》听Lingge讲打工换宿</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4740">1:19:00</a> 如果给“地下室人”连上网会怎样？</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4980">1:23:00</a> 有问题问CHATGPT: 全世界都来帮你，包括你自己</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5040">1:24:00</a> 沈从文：我将永远为现象倾心，不加以世俗的偏见</span></strong></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5160">1:26:00</a> 尼采视角下的「神甫」与「艺术家」</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>提及作品</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《弗朗西斯·哈》</span></strong><span>（美）</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27255441/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27255441/"><span>诺亚·鲍姆巴赫</span></a><span> / </span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27228379/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27228379/"><span>格蕾塔·葛韦格</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>图书《自伤自恋的精神分析》</span></strong><span>（日）</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%8B%E8%97%A4%E7%8E%AF" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E6%96%8B%E8%97%A4%E7%8E%AF"><span>斋藤环</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>图书《地下室手记》</span></strong><a href="https://book.douban.com/search/%E9%99%80%E6%80%9D%E5%A6%A5%E8%80%B6%E5%A4%AB%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA" data-url="https://book.douban.com/search/%E9%99%80%E6%80%9D%E5%A6%A5%E8%80%B6%E5%A4%AB%E6%96%AF%E5%9F%BA"><span>(俄罗斯) 陀思妥耶夫斯基</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《太阳照常升起》</span></strong><span>姜文</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《好东西》</span></strong><span> 邵艺辉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《一个国家的诞生》</span></strong><span>（美）</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27210566/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27210566/"><span>大卫·格里菲斯</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《教父》</span></strong><span>（美）</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27260187/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27260187/"><span>弗朗西斯·福特·科波拉</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>播客节目 《电影巨辩·为了华语电影》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电影《同流者》</span></strong><span>（意大利）</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27241399/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27241399/"><span>贝纳尔多·贝托鲁奇</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>电视剧《布莱克书店》</span></strong><span>（英）</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/personage/27246412/" data-url="https://www.douban.com/personage/27246412/"><span>迪兰·莫兰</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>书籍《从文自传》</span></strong><span>沈从文</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>关于尼采</span></strong><span>：尼采将人分为“神甫”与“艺术家”这种说法，见于</span><strong><span>法国思想家罗兰•巴特给安东尼奥尼的一封信</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>“亲爱的安东尼奥尼：</span><br><span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;尼采在他的类型学中区分了两种人：神甫和艺术家。我们现在所拥有的神甫已经大大超过所需：所有宗教的和宗教之外的；然而艺术家呢？亲爱的安东尼奥尼，如果您愿意，请允许我快速地回顾一下您作品的一些特性，从而把握在我看来就成为艺术家而言所必备的三种能力，或者说是品质。我将它们称作：关注、智慧、至为荒谬的是—— 脆弱。”</span></em></p><span></span><p><strong><span>🎵BGM：卡米耶·圣桑 动物狂欢节 序曲及狮王进行曲</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🖼</span><strong><span>平面设计：西子Sunny（</span></strong><em><strong><span>小红书 西子Sunny</span></strong></em><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📪</span><strong><span>联系我们：Lingge （</span></strong><em><strong><span>小红书 Linggeりんか；小宇宙 时差一小时</span></strong></em><strong><span>）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>老张</span></strong><em><strong><span>（小红书 新建序列影像研习室；合作邮箱 harryzhang0127@163.com)</span></strong></em></p>]]></description>
